  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ice_Orok_Runt.png\" title=\"Ice Orok Runt\"><img alt=\"Ice Orok Runt\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ice_Orok_Runt.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ice_Orok_Runt.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Ice Orok Runt</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b>  Orok\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fodder\n</p><p>These are the smallest of the Orok race.  They come in large crowds but are easily destroyed with area spells.  These little creatures also go by the name of Runts or Sprites.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Hatchling\n</td><td> ---\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Spawn\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Orok Spawn\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Orok Spawn\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GoS spawn camper!\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[HAX] Spawn\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Haxhaxor Libratorium</a> off <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Runt\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Orok Runt\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snow Sprite\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Supply_Depot\" title=\"Vergrim's Supply Depot\">Vergrim's Supply Depot</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flame Sprite\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Crematorium\" title=\"Crematorium\">Crematorium</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tomb_of_Singe\" title=\"Tomb of Singe\">Tomb of Singe</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Earth Sprite\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Storerooms</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
